# ============================================================
# GKUI-Pack 忽略规则
# 硬约束 C5:本仓库不得提交任何 .apk
# 验收:git ls-files | grep -c '\.apk$' == 0
# APK 一律由 CI 从 GitHub Releases 下载并校验 sha256。
# ============================================================

# --- APK / 安装包(严禁提交) ---
*.apk
*.apks
*.xapk
*.apkm

# --- 构建产物 ---
dist/
build/
out/
*.zip

# --- 签名材料(严禁提交) ---
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pepk
*.pem
*.der

# --- preflight / 构建报告产物(build.sh 与 CI 生成) ---
PREFLIGHT-REPORT.md
apps.json
module/.preflight.json

# --- 临时文件 ---
*.tmp
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
